= Publications and Preprints

~~~
{}{raw}
<p><strong>Research interest:</strong> I am broadly interested in statistical machine learning, where I develop reliable methods and theory for large-scale and complex statistical problems. In particular, I have been working on the following topics: <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="0" href="#topic-uncertainty-quantification">uncertainty quantification</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="1" href="#topic-interpretable-machine-learning">interpretable machine learning</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="2" href="#topic-statistical-learning">statistical learning</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="3" href="#topic-ensemble-methods">ensemble methods</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="4" href="#topic-data-integration">data integration</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="5" href="#topic-spectral-methods">spectral methods</a>, <a class="research-topic-link" data-topic="6" href="#topic-graph-learning">graph learning</a>.</p>
~~~

(\*: equal contribution; †: student advisee.)

